# Commits

When committing (only if the user asks):

- Use **caveman-commit**: Conventional Commits, short subject, body only for non-obvious why.
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by`, `Generated with …`, `Assisted-by`, or any AI/tool credit trailer.
- Clean message only, e.g. `fix(mod): stop double-ban on rejoin`
